## ✦ Formal Structure

Let **I** be environmental intensity, defined by:

- gravitational potential depth  
- tidal index (T)  
- filament infall rate  
- local density fluctuations  

Let **B** be burstiness (SFH variance).  
Let **Sₓ** be chemical tempo (enrichment slope).

Then:

- **B ∝ I**  
- **Sₓ ∝ I**  
- **Channel assignment is a function of I**

