## ✦ Interpretation  
The Rebirth Law reframes dwarf galaxy evolution as a **metabolic system**:

- Low‑pressure environments → slow metabolism  
- Moderate environments → overfueled metabolism  
- High‑pressure environments → hyper‑metabolic chemical engines  

This provides a unified conceptual framework for interpreting dwarf galaxy behavior across cosmic structures.

